			"notes": "### Combat Logging Detection\n- When a player gets hit with the crown, they will be \"In Combat\" for 30 seconds\n- If they leave during this period, it will count as a \"combat log\"\n\n- When a player combat logs with the crown, the crown will be transferred to the person who attacked them most recently.\n- If no one has attacked them very recently, but they still left in combat, the crown will move to the altar!\n\n- Added /removespeedglitch, which is a manual fix to anyone with the \"Speed Glitch\" bug\n  - /removespeedglitch will remove the speed glitch of the person who runs the command\n- Also added an admin version of the command, /fremovespeedglitch, that can remove the speed glitch from any player (other than yourself)\n- Added /forceremovecrown, which will remove the crown from anyone specified in the player argument\n\n### ALL EXPLOSIONS no longer destroys items!"
		},
